# Sunyshore City (the original's CITY08 role): the solar-powered city on Sinnoh's eastern tip, its streets raised on
# walkways of solar panels, the market and the beach below, the Vista Lighthouse looking out to the Pokémon League
# and an electric Gym. A bright E-major tune in the sun: a synth lead skipping over a calypso bass, a guitar's
# off-beat strums and a pulse glittering in sixteenths like light on the panels, a marimba answering like a steel pan;
# the middle opens out as the strings swell, and a bridge climbs the flattened sixth and seventh to the top of the lighthouse.
# By night a clarinet, a harp, a celesta and a vibraphone. Original composition for this game.
title Sunyshore City
tempo 138
